{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S03、S13等段的感受提示仍然偏密，短时间内容易顾着扫词而忽略音乐；Y的左右分区在视觉整理上更清爽。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然信息更丰富，但【】重点突出、话语分段明确，而且感受提示按音乐进程出现，实际观看时不必一次消化全部信息。更重要的是，X把人物心理变化之间的因果关系交代得更细，例如亲近回忆越鲜活，过去受过的委屈反而越明显；不服气逐渐消退后，离开那些人的难受才真正显露。这些细节让前后不只是情绪轮流出现，而是一个人逐渐理解自己的过程；音乐感受也比Y更具体，有力度、音型、节奏、音色和身体反应的层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa983f14-22d1-4dd5-a1bc-50751e0813f3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T011602475869Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:17:21.872505+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a519ba605346c0d2102eb994df5b0b8ee1dbb04d5cdf3a31d5106abe838f8dc6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat